{"id":"n31516-1-9","stage":5,"title":"검거 · 捉拿","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31516-1-9-1","ko":"범인 검거는 어떻게 됐대?","zh":"听说抓捕犯人的进展怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"범인","meaning":"犯人，罪犯","explanation":"범인：犯人，罪犯","readings":[{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14455","senseId":"1","lemma":"범인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}},{"text":"검거는","meaning":"捉拿，抓获，抓捕","explanation":"검거：捉拿，抓获，抓捕；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"검거","audio":"/audio/b7db007295aa59dbc9ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31516","senseId":"1","lemma":"검거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검거는","audio":"/audio/b8d7419b7946a7ab2eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됐대?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐대","audio":"/audio/f2ab37977175903c2147.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"29d23f06ebca35bd","term":"범인","zh":"犯人，罪犯","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3","entryId":"14455","definition":"违反法律、犯了错误的人。","pronunciation":["버ː민"]},{"id":"b7db007295aa59db","term":"검거","zh":"捉拿，抓获，抓捕","audio":"/audio/b7db007295aa59dbc9ef.mp3","entryId":"31516","definition":"搜查机关把违法或犯罪的人抓起来关押。","pronunciation":["검ː거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/430a8acc7ed6cc73a086.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31516-1-9-2","ko":"아직 증거도 못 찾았다는 거 보니 당분간은 힘들겠어.","zh":"看样子连证据都还没找到，短期内应该很难办吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"증거도","meaning":"证据","explanation":"증거：证据；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"증거","audio":"/audio/80aab8a91c1700f3ce44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27745","senseId":"1","lemma":"증거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"증거도","audio":"/audio/944f2959b8b616f7a001.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았다는","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았다는","audio":"/audio/7e4beff52a65dbbb7f9b.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"당분간은","meaning":"暂时，暂且","explanation":"당분간：暂时，暂且；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"당분간","audio":"/audio/8c78f09dbd688b308699.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14254","senseId":"1","lemma":"당분간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당분간은","audio":"/audio/8d311a192883d270a5f8.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들겠어.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들겠어","audio":"/audio/82527364e69d1fb0db3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"80aab8a91c1700f3","term":"증거","zh":"证据","audio":"/audio/80aab8a91c1700f3ce44.mp3","entryId":"27745","definition":"可证明某个案件或事实的依据。","pronunciation":["증거"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8c78f09dbd688b30","term":"당분간","zh":"暂时，暂且","audio":"/audio/8c78f09dbd688b308699.mp3","entryId":"14254","definition":"今后一段时间。","pronunciation":["당분간"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b4c8f61fb9e8300263f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.262,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31516","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看样子连证据都还没找到，短期内应该很难办吧。","那个说要分手的女朋友，我可是拼命挽留她的呢。","听说抓捕犯人的进展怎么样了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看样子连证据都还没找到，短期内应该很难办吧。","听说抓捕犯人的进展怎么样了？","那个说要分手的女朋友，我可是拼命挽留她的呢。"],"answer":0}]}
